OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FOn Friday, Andy Burnham announced his
OL,7,Flatest policy to "take power out of
OL,8,FWestminster", giving regional mayors
OL,9,Fin England a share of income tax to
OL,10,Fspend in their local communities.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said this latest
OL,13,Fannouncement means that "every local
OL,14,Fleader will have the power and
OL,15,Fresources to improve public transport,
OL,16,Fbuild homes and create jobs".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
