FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FAlthough the full details aren't clear
OL,7,Fyet, it's expected that a full white
OL,8,Fpaper will be published after the
OL,9,FChancellor John Healey presents his
OL,10,Ffirst budget in the autumn.
OL,12,FThis latest devolved policy follows
OL,13,Fhis major move in his first week as
OL,14,Fprime minister to open No 10 North, a
OL,15,Fbase in Manchester which he called
OL,16,F"the nerve centre of a rewired
OL,17,FBritain", with a focus on extending
OL,18,Fdevolution across the country.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
