OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FBut what exactly is devolution and why
OL,7,Fis the new prime minister such an
OL,8,Fadvocate for this reallocation of
OL,9,Fpower?
OL,11,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,12,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,13,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,14,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,16,FWhat is devolution?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FAccording to the parliamentary
OL,7,Fdefinition, "devolution is the
OL,8,Fdecentralisation of governmental
OL,9,Fpower" and over the last 20 years, the
OL,10,FUK has seen a mix of powers and
OL,11,Ffunding transferred out of Whitehall
OL,12,Fand Westminster.
OL,14,FSome examples of this are the
OL,15,Fformulation of parliaments in the
OL,16,Fnations of Northern Ireland, Scotland
OL,17,Fand Wales as well as the creation of
OL,18,Fthe London Assembly.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FMore recently, it has seen the
OL,7,Fintroduction of 14 mayors across
OL,8,FEngland, including London, Manchester,
OL,9,FLiverpool and the West of England.
OL,11,FThese mayors and parliaments have
OL,12,Fdifferent powers over their local
OL,13,Fareas.
OL,15,FFor example in Wales, devolution saw
OL,16,Fthe Senedd (the Welsh parliament)
OL,17,Fcreate Transport for Wales, coordinate
OL,18,Fits own education system, reduce speed
OL,19,Flimits across the nation and even
OL,20,Fbecome the first UK nation to
OL,21,Fintroduce a carrier bag charge.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FSome of this devolution has meant that
OL,7,Fsome of Burnham's policies won't apply
OL,8,Foutside of England, like the #2 bus
OL,9,Ffare cap, as transport is devolved in
OL,10,Fthe nations and in Scotland, the plan
OL,11,Fwas already in place for #2 fares,
OL,12,Fwhich has just been extended.
OL,14,FThe Centre for Cities claims the UK is
OL,15,Fthe most centralised in governance out
OL,16,Fof any of the G7 countries, with 95%
OL,17,Fof tax paid going into central
OL,18,Fgovernment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FThe think tank says allocating more
OL,7,Ftax money to devolved powers can help
OL,8,Fimprove economic growth, suggesting
OL,9,Fmayoral authorities can manage growth
OL,10,Fif they are more fiscally devolved
OL,11,Ffrom the government.
OL,13,FOne example is when new homes are
OL,14,Fbuilt, incomes rise or new residents
OL,15,Fmove in, causing an overall increase
OL,16,Fto funding for the authority, allowing
OL,17,Flocal policymakers to invest in issues
OL,18,Fspecific to their areas.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FBurnham has said he wants a principle
OL,7,Fof "devolving by default" where
OL,8,Fsecretaries of state need to justify
OL,9,Fwhy they have powers over something
OL,10,Finstead of elected mayors.
OL,12,FHowever, the PM has no concrete plan
OL,13,Fon the exact funding for his
OL,14,Fdevolution vision or potential
OL,15,Frestrictions on spending. It is
OL,16,Funclear yet exactly how much it will
OL,17,Fbenefit local authorities.
OL,19,FWhy is Andy Burnham so keen on it?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
