OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FBurnham is the former Mayor of Greater
OL,7,FManchester, a position that exists
OL,8,Fbecause of the principle of
OL,9,Fdevolution, which he was elected as in
OL,10,F2017.
OL,12,FIn the run up to his coronation as
OL,13,FLabour leader, he talked about
OL,14,Fbringing his "Manchesterism" to the UK.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
