PN,30910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FHe has repeatedly referenced his work
OL,7,Fin Manchester, as a model for the UK,
OL,8,Fexplaining that when power is moved to
OL,9,Fan area instead of staying in
OL,10,FWestminster, the economy can grow,
OL,11,Fjobs can be created and people will be
OL,12,Fbetter off.
OL,14,FIn his nearly 10-year term,
OL,15,FManchester's economic performance
OL,16,Foutgrew all UK cities outside of
OL,17,FLondon.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
