FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30911
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FThe Productivity Institute reporting
OL,7,Fthat Manchester's Manchester's Gross
OL,8,FValue Added (GVA) per hour worked grew
OL,9,F42% between 2015 and 2023, compared to
OL,10,Fthe national average of 28% ` a
OL,11,Fmeasure including inflation plus
OL,12,Fproductivity share.
OL,14,FBurnham introduced the Bee Network, a
OL,15,Fjoined up transport system similar to
OL,16,FLondon's across the region with capped
OL,17,Ffares and increased services all run
OL,18,Fby a private operator under public
OL,19,Fcontrol.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30912
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FHe also introduced "A New Deal for
OL,7,FRenters" in an effort to improve
OL,8,Fhousing, including legal support and a
OL,9,Fgood landlord charter, all things made
OL,10,Fpossible by the devolved power in his
OL,11,Farea.
OL,13,FHe has faced criticism in the past for
OL,14,Fhis focus on the centre of Manchester,
OL,15,Fleaving the outer edges and towns
OL,16,Fbehind but he is continually confident
OL,17,Fhe left Manchester in a better state
OL,18,Fthan when he arrived.
OL,20,FWhat does he plan to do about it?
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
