OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FBurnham started in his first week with
OL,7,Fthe opening of No 10 North, supposedly
OL,8,Fa centre to drive growth across the
OL,9,FUK, a base to focus on taking power
OL,10,Fout of Westminster.
OL,12,FIt seems this was just the start.
OL,14,FBurnham has said he wants a principle
OL,15,Fof "devolving by default" where
OL,16,Fsecretaries of state need to justify
OL,17,Fwhy they have powers over something
OL,18,Finstead of elected mayors.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
