PN,30914
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FHis announcement on Friday that his
OL,7,Fold friends, the regional mayors, will
OL,8,Freceive a share of income tax and
OL,9,Fbusiness rates to invest locally is
OL,10,Fseen as a step towards tax devolution,
OL,11,Fwith the potential to bolster economic
OL,12,Fgrowth.
OL,14,FFrom 2027, the mayoralties will
OL,15,Freceive a greater share of business
OL,16,Frate revenue and from April 2028, they
OL,17,Fwill also get a share of income tax.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30915
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FThe plan also allows mayors to
OL,7,Fintroduce a tourism levy to their
OL,8,Fregion, but mayors have to explain how
OL,9,Fthey'd spend this funding before doing
OL,10,Fit.
OL,12,FThis has turned into one of the main
OL,13,Fcriticisms of the policy whereby the
OL,14,Fgovernment claims it is handing power
OL,15,Fback to communities but then also
OL,16,Ftelling them how to spend their money.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
