PN,30916
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FThere is already an argument brewing
OL,7,Fbetween mayors from different parties
OL,8,Fand the PM after he suggested that
OL,9,Fthey cannot spend the reallocated
OL,10,Ffunding on tax rebates for local
OL,11,Fpeople.
OL,13,FThe Conservative Tees Valley Mayor Ben
OL,14,FHouchen has questioned whether this
OL,15,Fmoney is devolved or not after the
OL,16,Fprime minister and Louise Haigh said
OL,17,Fit had to be spent on public services
OL,18,Fand improving local communities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
