PN,30917
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FBurnham has promised "growth in every
OL,7,Fpostcode" but critics argue this
OL,8,Fpolicy will only benefit areas with
OL,9,Fmayors.
OL,11,FLabour MP for Camborne and Redruth,
OL,12,FPerran Moon, is among these voices,
OL,13,Fsuggesting his region of Cornwall will
OL,14,Fbecome "excluded from the highest
OL,15,Flevel of devolution".
OL,17,FCornwall Council held a public
OL,18,Fconsultation in 2023 on whether to
OL,19,Fhave a directly elected mayor, with
OL,20,F69% of respondents opposing the model.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30918
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FMoon has pushed back against a
OL,7,Fproposed joint mayor with Devon,
OL,8,Fsuggesting it would infringe on
OL,9,FCornwall's national minority status.
OL,11,FThe government's ambition is for every
OL,12,Farea to have a "strategic authority"
OL,13,Fby the end of 2027, or at least in the
OL,14,Fprocess of establishing one in time
OL,15,Ffor 2028.
OL,17,FThese strategic authorities will have
OL,18,Fsome but not all the powers of a
OL,19,Fmayoral authority, but could introduce
OL,20,Fa tourist levy for example.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30919
SC,0019
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F309A1785538099
OL,3,CWhat is devolution and why is Andy
OL,4,CBurnham always talking about it?
OL,6,FThey also said they will not impose
OL,7,Fmayors on areas that don't want one
OL,8,Fbut also say that "'accountable mayors
OL,9,Frepresent the strongest form of
OL,10,Fgovernance available", and have said
OL,11,Fpowers will be "commensurately
OL,12,Fgreater" if you have one.
OL,14,FTwo weeks in, Burnham has made it
OL,15,Fclear that he wants more power outside
OL,16,Fof Whitehall, it was clear this was
OL,17,Fhis position before even stepping into
OL,18,FDowning Street.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G19/20
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
